FR:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ça sent le printemps,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} j'aurais
peut-être dû me déguiser en fleur{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
pour fêter l'occasion ?
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}D'ailleurs,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} toi aussi, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Chiche, on va s'éclater, hi hi !

EN:
So I was off digging in the ground,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
right? {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}And I found an egg! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Not, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}like,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
an old dinosaur egg or anything...
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}but a pretty little egg! {{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Let me know
if you see anything like that today,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ah, me ha pasado algo alucinante!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} 
¿A que no sabes qué ha salido de
un roca que he golpeado?
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¡Un huevo! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¡O sea, normalmente
salen piedras preciosas, no huevos!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Muy fuerte.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I was just standing over there{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
minding my own business, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}when
suddenly{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0029:}}an egg fell on my head!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I was right under a tree when it
happened. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Do you think {{TAG:0005:0004:00CD}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
was playing a prank on me?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Estaba yo tan tranquila debajo de
un árbol cuando, de repente,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0029:}}¡me cayó un huevo en la cabeza!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}¿Será una broma de {{TAG:0005:0004:00CD}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
¡Ya verá cuando l{{TAG:000E:0007:02006F0002006100}} pille!

FR:
Devine un peu qui a éclaté un ballon
au lance-pierre, hein ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Vas-y,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
devine ?! {{TAG:0003:0021:}}C'est moi, banane !
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Et attends un peu de savoir ce qui y
était accroché{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:000F:}}un œuf !!!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Véridique !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}There's definitely something special{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
about those eggs. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}They're sure not
filled with yolk,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} I can tell you that!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}C'è qualcosa di molto strano{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
in queste uova. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Non hanno nemmeno
